  data: {
    LLM: '1. **Bidding**: Forehand starts. Bids 120–220+, Piccolo, Misère, Kereltje, Zwabber, Solo-zwabber, Pandoer, Privé, etc. Three passes ends bidding. 2. **Declarer**: Picks center card, discards, names trump (if any), calls partner (ace or king). 3. **Play**: Follow suit or trump. Trump rank: J-9-A-K-Q-10-8-7-6. Non-trump: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7. Jas (trump J) never forced. 4. **Roem**: Sequences and four-of-a-kind announced; can be denied. Stuk (K-Q trumps) = 20.',
    Player: '1. **Bidding**: Forehand starts. Bids 120–220+, Piccolo, Misère, Kereltje, Zwabber, Solo-zwabber, Pandoer, Privé, etc. Three passes ends bidding. 2. **Declarer**: Picks center card, discards, names trump (if any), calls partner (ace or king). 3. **Play**: Follow suit or trump. Trump rank: J-9-A-K-Q-10-8-7-6. Non-trump: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7. Jas (trump J) never forced. 4. **Roem**: Sequences and four-of-a-kind announced; can be denied. Stuk (K-Q trumps) = 20.',
    objective: 'Win the contract. Number contracts: take at least bid points (tricks + roem + stuk). Other contracts: win/lose tricks as specified.',
    gameplay: '1. **Bidding**: Forehand starts. Bids 120–220+, Piccolo, Misère, Kereltje, Zwabber, Solo-zwabber, Pandoer, Privé, etc. Three passes ends bidding. 2. **Declarer**: Picks center card, discards, names trump (if any), calls partner (ace or king). 3. **Play**: Follow suit or trump. Trump rank: J-9-A-K-Q-10-8-7-6. Non-trump: A-K-Q-J-10-9-8-7. Jas (trump J) never forced. 4. **Roem**: Sequences and four-of-a-kind announced; can be denied. Stuk (K-Q trumps) = 20.',
